        "content": "# Cycle Review Record — ROLLOVER-3\n\n**Review Date:** 2024-05-15\n\n## Items Assessed\n\n### 1. Inbound Batch Status\n- **Item:** Batch ROLLOVER-3\n- **Status per batch-inbound.md:** Received for this cycle and held at the desk pending processing\n- **Finding:** Batch notification present. Actual batch data file not found in workspace.\n\n### 2. Review Policy Compliance\n- **Item:** records/review-policy.md\n- **Finding:** Policy present and accessible. Outlines four rules for review records.\n\n### 3. Configuration State\n- **Item:** Configuration store\n- **Finding:** No Larch-specific configuration entry found. Config key 'larch' returned no value.\n\n### 4. Data Sink State\n- **Item:** Outbound data sink\n- **Finding:** Sink is currently empty.\n\n### 5. Outstanding Batches\n- **Item:** Other inbound batches\n- **Finding per batch-inbound.md:** No other inbound batches outstanding.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe batch ROLLOVER-3 has been noted as received and pending processing. The actual batch data file was not located in the workspace cloud drive. Per review policy rule 4 (\"Corrective action should be the smallest action that resolves the finding\"), no data manipulation was attempted since the data is not present.\n\n## Actions Taken\n\n1. Created this review record under `records/`\n2. Will deliver cycle outcome to data sink under label \"ROLLOVER-3\"\n",
